Commit:     Fabricio Breve <fbreve@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Sat Oct 24 15:13:41 2026 -0300

    Preserve VDP background pipeline across savestates
    
    Preserve the historical background pipeline state required for exact rendering after savestate restore.
    
    Extend the tagged savestate format to version 15 and restore the live pipeline state that cannot be reconstructed from VRAM, registers, and beam position alone.
    
    Prevent identical savestate images from producing different visible futures and preserve exact rendering across repeated LOADs.

